{
  "_note": "全球数据中心健康(regions 卡 + 首页块)。生成器 tools/infosource/gen_cloudflare.py,计数手法见其文件头。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cacheIn",
        "value": "${cache}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地(§9.5 #3:方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${_cacheIn},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "1 = 首页块(读缓存);组件不传 = 0。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_t0",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_zk",
        "value": "${zoneId}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地,键表达式里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。无域名参数的流里恒空,不影响。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ck",
        "value": "c.cf.rg"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "_hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${_ck}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${_hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "页面有缓存 → 整段跳过(连接都不建);组件 / 无缓存 → 真取数。取数体里的 fail_unless 失败即终止整条流,所以走到 data.set 的一定是取到了的。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${_cache},1),if::(gt::(${_hitTs},0),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "raw",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.cloudflarestatus.com/api/v2/components.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          },
          "_note": "取**原文**(string):按大洲计数靠正则切分,见文件头。约 175KB。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${raw}),1000),0,1)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "cf_status_unreachable"
              }
            }
          ],
          "_note": "取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "reT_as",
            "value": "\"group_id\":\"77867vxkttgw\""
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "reO_as",
            "value": "\"status\":\"operational\"[^{}]*\"group_id\":\"77867vxkttgw\""
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "reM_as",
            "value": "\"status\":\"under_maintenance\"[^{}]*\"group_id\":\"77867vxkttgw\""
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t_as",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${raw},${reT_as}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "o_as",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${raw},${reO_as}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "m_as",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${raw},${reM_as}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "i_as",
            "value": "$[max::(calc::(${t_as}-${o_as}-${m_as}),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "xo_as",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(4.0+(${o_as}/max::(${t_as},1))*166.0),4.0),0.0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "xm_as",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(4.0+((${o_as}+${m_as})/max::(${t_as},1))*166.0),4.0),0.0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "xa_as",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(4.0+(min::(${t_as},1))*166.0),4.0),0.0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "reT_eu",
            "value": "\"group_id\":\"zqxhg7y54vy8\""
          }
        },
